        skos:definition        "Surface pressure recorded just before the previous descent. This is a cumulative offset, negative offsets truncated to 0. Not autocorrected. In real-time, subtract the cumulative offset from the reported pressures of the present profile. In DMQC, apply this value to the reported pressures of the PREVIOUS profile. Unlike the previous name, it DOES NOT have 5db added and so this does not need to be removed before use. Template_Values:{unit:[bar, dbar, cbar, mbar, inHg]}."@en;
